WEBVTT

46:30.356 --> 46:33.233
It's a good weapon for a Dothrakan.

46:34.401 --> 46:38.530
But a man in full plate... (SPEAKS DOTHRAKI)

46:38.655 --> 46:40.741
...the arakh won't get through the steel.

46:41.909 --> 46:44.078
That's where the broadsword
has the advantage.

46:44.203 --> 46:47.081
Designed for piercing plate.

46:48.749 --> 46:51.502
Dothraki don't wear steel dresses.

46:51.627 --> 46:54.546
(SPEAKS ENGLISH) Armor.
(SPEAKS ENGLISH) Armor.

46:54.671 --> 46:57.299
Armor make a man, erm...

46:57.424 --> 46:59.385
- (SPEAKS DOTHRAKI)
- Slow.

46:59.510 --> 47:03.097
- Slow.
- It's true, but it also keeps a man alive.
